            "tab_3_title": "Primed",
            "tab_3_headline": "Comes Assembled!",
            "tab_3_paragraph": "We apply a primer coat in various colors. This is an ideal choice if you intend to paint the miniatures yourself, as the basic plastic doesn't retain paint well without this preparation. Comes in black, red, and grey.",
